            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abanyakutaho ebiragiro ebibi ebitali by'obwinganiza n'abahandiiki abaikara nibahandiika ebintu eby'okubonabonesa abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaikara nibahandiika ebintu eby'okutanga abaseege okukolerwa eby'obwinganiza, n'ebyokunyaga abanaku ab'omu bantu bange ebintu byabo, nukwo benyagire abafaakati babonabonese enfuuzi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olikora ki ha kiro eky'okufubirwa obu haliteera ihunga eririruga hara? Obu haliija okuhwerekerra okuliruga hara. Olyebinga oha ow'alikukoonyera, itungo lyawe olirisiga nkaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baliba batakyaina eki basobora kukora okwihaho okwesereka omu banyankomo, rundi kugwa omu mitumbi enyakwisirwe. Ebi byona noobu biribaho, ekiniga MUKAMA tikirimuhwaho, aliikara agoroire omukono afubire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
