            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki MUKAMA, MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati: “Inywe abantu bange abanyakwikara Siyoni mutatiina, Abasiriya obu baliimukya emiigo yabo kubateera nk'Abamisiri oku baakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba omu kacu kake kati, ndirekera aho kubiihirirwa inywe, ndibiihirirwa Abasiriya mbahwerekereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe, alibateeza embooko nkooku yakozire Abamidyani, ha mwandara ogwa Orebbu; omwigo gwe aligwimukya ha nyanja, aligwimukya nkooku yakozire omunsi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, nubwo alibaiha omu busobozi bw'Abasiriya, abajune ekikoligo eki baabataire ha mabega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ery'abanyanzigwa lihambire orubuga Ai! Ebintu byabo babisigire Makimasi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkiro bagicwanganiize, Gibbeya nuho barukwija kugoonya; Rama neetukumira; Gibbeya eya Saulo irukire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwamuze inywe aba Galimu! Mutege amatu muhurre inywe aba Laisa, inywe aba Anatoosi, mumugarukemu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Medimeena nibasingwa nibairuka enzarwa eza Gebimu nabo nibaserra h'okwesereka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kya hati kinu, Abanyanzigwa barahika omurubuga noobu baraazinga entomi bazooleke orubuga Siyoni, orwa Yerusaalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
